# Versioning (omnishpilot)

Same as the **global** rule `~/.cursor/rules/versioning-start-0-0-1.mdc`. Do not invent a different scheme.

```
0.0.1 → 0.0.99 → 0.1.0 → … → 0.99.99 → 1.0.0
```

Only **`+0.0.1`** (normal) or **`+0.0.5`** (major/large capability), then carry after 99.

From `0.0.6`: normal → `0.0.7`; major → `0.0.11`.

Human copy: [VERSIONING.md](../../VERSIONING.md). Keep `package.json`, skill metadata, git tag, and npm publish identical.
